group features/cli
note tour-group <name> <group>: put one tour in a group. The agent reaches for it so the tours list stays navigable by area as the map grows, instead of one flat list (commit 10dc7e690b8b). / nests groups (flows/http); an empty group puts the tour at the top level. The group is created by being named: nothing else declares it.

